1
00:01:43,239 --> 00:01:44,079
That means

2
00:01:45,319 --> 00:01:48,000
as soon as Li Qiang arrived, the local police

3
00:01:48,000 --> 00:01:48,920
had their eyes on him.

4
00:01:50,560 --> 00:01:51,680
That seems to be the case.

5
00:01:51,920 --> 00:01:53,840
The intel on Li Qiang

6
00:01:54,640 --> 00:01:56,239
was leaked to the police by Jin Qiang.

7
00:01:56,359 --> 00:01:57,159
It had nothing to do with us,

8
00:01:57,319 --> 00:01:59,120
nor with Li Qiang directly.

9
00:01:59,959 --> 00:02:00,599
Lao Ma,

10
00:02:01,719 --> 00:02:04,319
do you think the police's real target

11
00:02:05,040 --> 00:02:06,000
might be you?

12
00:02:10,639 --> 00:02:11,960
Probably not.

13
00:02:12,879 --> 00:02:14,159
If it were me,

14
00:02:14,159 --> 00:02:15,759
I wouldn't be sitting here.

15
00:02:19,840 --> 00:02:21,199
Did Li Qiang ever tell you

16
00:02:21,360 --> 00:02:23,719
the background of that woman with him?

17
00:02:26,159 --> 00:02:28,520
He seemed very reluctant to bring her up.

18
00:02:28,960 --> 00:02:30,199
And that woman...

19
00:02:31,159 --> 00:02:32,400
my gut tells me

20
00:02:32,960 --> 00:02:34,719
she was forced to come to Country M.

21
00:02:37,360 --> 00:02:38,520
Coerced?

22
00:02:39,639 --> 00:02:40,439
That's right.

23
00:02:41,560 --> 00:02:42,599
We're both men.

24
00:02:43,360 --> 00:02:45,240
Even though Li Qiang cares about her,

25
00:02:46,000 --> 00:02:48,960
and she follows him around every day,

26
00:02:49,439 --> 00:02:50,120
still,

27
00:02:50,879 --> 00:02:53,360
all I saw in her eyes was fear.

28
00:02:57,080 --> 00:02:58,280
Alright, no need to guess.

29
00:02:58,360 --> 00:02:59,039
Once we meet Li Qiang,

30
00:02:59,240 --> 00:03:00,759
everything will be clear.

31
00:03:27,840 --> 00:03:30,240
You really opened my eyes today, Mr. Qin.

32
00:03:30,800 --> 00:03:32,199
With just a simple trick,

33
00:03:32,680 --> 00:03:35,400
you made the undercover cop blow his cover.

34
00:03:37,159 --> 00:03:40,960
Your Chinese is getting better and better.

35
00:03:43,479 --> 00:03:46,080
Since I'll be working with you Chinese,

36
00:03:46,400 --> 00:03:48,919
I definitely need to improve my Chinese.

37
00:03:49,400 --> 00:03:51,360
Wouldn't want you talking behind my back,

38
00:03:51,520 --> 00:03:52,879
while I just smile along with you.

39
00:03:57,039 --> 00:03:58,919
Why is traffic so bad?

40
00:04:22,560 --> 00:04:23,600
Sophia,

41
00:04:36,839 --> 00:04:38,439
Just two more streets to the Dai village.

42
00:04:38,959 --> 00:04:41,000
Today is the Dai people's market day.

43
00:04:41,199 --> 00:04:42,519
It's bound to be bustling.

44
00:04:46,519 --> 00:04:48,120
We've been in Country M for so long,

45
00:04:48,439 --> 00:04:50,040
yet you've never taken me to the market.

46
00:04:50,040 --> 00:04:51,319
Come with me in a bit, okay?

47
00:04:52,519 --> 00:04:53,120
Sister-in-law,

48
00:04:53,480 --> 00:04:55,399
you and Siqi are thinking the same thing.

49
00:04:55,920 --> 00:04:57,519
Just a moment ago, she told me

50
00:04:57,879 --> 00:04:58,959
that as soon as she saw you,

51
00:04:59,120 --> 00:05:01,399
she'd take you out for some real shopping.

52
00:05:03,480 --> 00:05:05,279
Xiao Zhuang, you can't go.

53
00:05:06,040 --> 00:05:06,920
You're coming with me

54
00:05:07,000 --> 00:05:08,839
to meet my buddy, Li Qiang.

55
00:05:11,480 --> 00:05:13,199
You always mention Li Qiang, Big Bro.

56
00:05:13,480 --> 00:05:15,480
I'm really curious to meet him in person.

57
00:05:29,319 --> 00:05:30,759
Brother Qin, pull over.

58
00:05:31,079 --> 00:05:31,639
What is it?

59
00:05:37,720 --> 00:05:38,639
Look at that alley.

60
00:05:38,959 --> 00:05:39,680
Do you remember?

61
00:05:39,680 --> 00:05:41,279
There's a place with great banana pancakes.

62
00:05:41,800 --> 00:05:42,480
I want some.

63
00:05:43,639 --> 00:05:44,639
Seriously?

64
00:05:44,720 --> 00:05:46,160
Why must you act on every whim?

65
00:05:46,160 --> 00:05:47,600
What do you mean, a whim?

66
00:05:47,800 --> 00:05:49,319
You wouldn't let me buy that bag earlier,

67
00:05:49,319 --> 00:05:50,319
and now I want banana pancakes,

68
00:05:50,319 --> 00:05:51,120
you won't even get them for me?

69
00:05:54,279 --> 00:05:55,279
Fine, fine. Go get them.

70
00:05:55,399 --> 00:05:56,319
Come right back once you do.

71
00:05:57,040 --> 00:05:58,319
Isn't this something you men

72
00:05:58,319 --> 00:05:59,120
are supposed to do for me?

73
00:05:59,360 --> 00:06:00,720
Why should I be the one going?

74
00:06:01,639 --> 00:06:02,120
Go on.

75
00:06:03,240 --> 00:06:04,399
It's that place. You remember it.

76
00:06:04,519 --> 00:06:05,079
Go on.

77
00:06:06,480 --> 00:06:07,279
Hurry up.

78
00:06:07,759 --> 00:06:09,519
Xiao Zhuang, just go.

79
00:06:09,839 --> 00:06:11,000
Bring me one too.

80
00:06:11,399 --> 00:06:13,079
See? Even Brother Ma said so.

81
00:06:13,079 --> 00:06:13,959
Hurry up and go buy them.

82
00:06:14,040 --> 00:06:15,519
If you don't go, you don't love me.

83
00:06:15,680 --> 00:06:17,120
Hurry. Go on!

84
00:06:17,399 --> 00:06:18,319
You're impossible...

85
00:06:18,319 --> 00:06:18,959
Drive on.

86
00:06:28,079 --> 00:06:29,040
Let's keep moving.

87
00:06:29,759 --> 00:06:30,240
All right.

88
00:06:54,720 --> 00:06:55,480
Our cover's about to be blown.

89
00:06:55,480 --> 00:06:56,439
Ge Dan's life is in danger.

90
00:07:16,759 --> 00:07:17,160
Well?

91
00:07:17,319 --> 00:07:19,120
Did you see your brother?

92
00:07:20,279 --> 00:07:23,079
My brother knows what he's doing.

93
00:07:23,480 --> 00:07:24,639
When the time comes,

94
00:07:24,680 --> 00:07:26,040
he'll show up.

95
00:07:33,560 --> 00:07:35,879
Brother Si, they're at Sophia Square.

96
00:07:58,600 --> 00:07:58,920
Let's go.

97
00:07:59,319 --> 00:08:00,319
Come see the boss with me.

98
00:08:11,920 --> 00:08:12,439
Boss,

99
00:08:14,399 --> 00:08:16,040
this is my friend, Li Qiang.

100
00:08:36,000 --> 00:08:37,440
Run! Hide!

101
00:09:26,679 --> 00:09:27,120
Let's go.

102
00:09:40,480 --> 00:09:41,399
Li Qiang!

103
00:10:06,360 --> 00:10:06,720
Let's go.

104
00:10:18,559 --> 00:10:19,320
The cops are here!

105
00:10:19,960 --> 00:10:20,879
Get in the car! Hurry!

106
00:10:51,600 --> 00:10:52,200
Hey, man.

107
00:10:55,840 --> 00:10:57,399
Relax, relax.

108
00:11:04,200 --> 00:11:05,679
You never saw me.

109
00:11:06,000 --> 00:11:07,559
Okay, okay.

110
00:11:21,240 --> 00:11:22,000
Are you okay?

111
00:11:23,000 --> 00:11:23,840
Zhuang Cen, where are you?

112
00:11:26,120 --> 00:11:26,759
I just heard gunshots.

113
00:11:26,919 --> 00:11:27,639
Are you guys okay?

114
00:11:28,320 --> 00:11:30,120
We're fine. Where are you? We'll find you.

115
00:11:32,360 --> 00:11:33,759
Go wait for me at Qin Mu's bar.

116
00:11:34,240 --> 00:11:35,840
Okay. Be careful.

117
00:11:39,679 --> 00:11:41,480
How is he? Is he okay?

118
00:11:41,799 --> 00:11:43,360
He's fine. Head to Qin Mu's bar.

119
00:11:43,919 --> 00:11:44,480
Got it.

120
00:12:25,600 --> 00:12:26,679
We're a step too late again.

121
00:12:39,759 --> 00:12:42,080
Looks like it's not that bad this time.

122
00:13:03,720 --> 00:13:04,799
Who would've thought

123
00:13:05,080 --> 00:13:06,679
we'd run into each other here?

124
00:13:07,480 --> 00:13:09,840
I didn't expect you to be alive either.

125
00:13:11,399 --> 00:13:12,440
Looking at things now,

126
00:13:12,679 --> 00:13:14,360
my luck's a little better than yours.

127
00:13:16,039 --> 00:13:17,720
But you haven't done too badly yourself.

128
00:13:18,559 --> 00:13:21,279
Got quite a beauty with you on the run.

129
00:13:24,039 --> 00:13:27,000
Look at all these guns pointed at you.

130
00:13:27,320 --> 00:13:28,679
Think you can make it out alive?

131
00:13:33,720 --> 00:13:34,440
Four-Legged Snake,

132
00:13:35,480 --> 00:13:36,200
let her go.

133
00:13:36,519 --> 00:13:37,960
I'll do whatever you want.

134
00:13:54,840 --> 00:13:55,399
Go.

135
00:13:55,840 --> 00:13:56,679
Wherever you go,

136
00:13:57,879 --> 00:13:59,480
I'll find you.

137
00:14:02,639 --> 00:14:03,240
Go.

138
00:14:05,360 --> 00:14:05,960
Go.

139
00:14:10,519 --> 00:14:11,200
Hurry up!

140
00:14:21,440 --> 00:14:23,399
This kid's still useful to us.

141
00:14:33,600 --> 00:14:35,639
Fine. Since this kid is dead,

142
00:14:36,080 --> 00:14:38,080
you can go join him.

143
00:14:38,639 --> 00:14:39,120
Brother Si.

144
00:14:40,600 --> 00:14:42,120
After Ma Jingrong and Qin Mu fled,

145
00:14:42,279 --> 00:14:43,480
they'll definitely find somewhere to hide.

146
00:14:43,799 --> 00:14:45,360
Li Qiang used to be Ma Jingrong's

147
00:14:45,360 --> 00:14:46,320
most trusted right-hand man.

148
00:14:46,639 --> 00:14:47,519
If we keep this woman alive,

149
00:14:47,679 --> 00:14:49,200
we might lure Ma Jingrong out.

150
00:14:50,600 --> 00:14:51,759
Li Qiang's woman?

151
00:14:51,879 --> 00:14:53,279
Why would Ma Jingrong save her?

152
00:14:53,919 --> 00:14:55,879
Didn't Brother Dong tell us to watch Qin Mu,

153
00:14:56,159 --> 00:14:57,919
and kill him and Ma Jingrong if we could?

154
00:14:58,120 --> 00:14:59,600
We can't return empty-handed.

155
00:15:00,720 --> 00:15:01,720
Taking this woman back

156
00:15:01,960 --> 00:15:02,919
at least gives us something to report.

157
00:15:04,639 --> 00:15:05,399
Take her away.

158
00:15:47,320 --> 00:15:47,840
Big Bro,

159
00:15:48,720 --> 00:15:49,799
what took you so long?

160
00:15:50,320 --> 00:15:50,759
What's wrong?

161
00:15:51,159 --> 00:15:52,000
Here's your pancake.

162
00:15:53,440 --> 00:15:55,000
Brother Ma, your pancake.

163
00:15:58,919 --> 00:16:00,159
What happened to everyone?

164
00:16:03,639 --> 00:16:05,080
I didn't expect Piyazi

165
00:16:05,080 --> 00:16:06,440
to send men after us so quickly.

166
00:16:07,600 --> 00:16:08,360
About this matter,

167
00:16:08,559 --> 00:16:10,120
I must tell Theerade.

168
00:16:12,840 --> 00:16:15,399
Everything we're doing now

169
00:16:16,360 --> 00:16:17,639
is for Theerade,

170
00:16:18,519 --> 00:16:20,080
expanding the Chinese market for him.

171
00:16:20,360 --> 00:16:22,519
He has no reason to be unhappy with us.

172
00:16:23,000 --> 00:16:24,799
Between Theerade and Piyazi,

173
00:16:24,960 --> 00:16:26,480
there was already a conflict of interest.

174
00:16:26,960 --> 00:16:29,360
A war between them is inevitable.

175
00:16:29,759 --> 00:16:31,080
Right now, for Theerade,

176
00:16:31,240 --> 00:16:32,840
we found buyers in mainland China

177
00:16:33,519 --> 00:16:35,480
and handled customs clearance for him.

178
00:16:35,840 --> 00:16:37,600
In the future, for Theerade

179
00:16:37,720 --> 00:16:39,120
to build a transport route in the mainland,

180
00:16:40,279 --> 00:16:41,679
he'll have to rely on us.

181
00:16:42,679 --> 00:16:44,120
In this matter with Piyazi,

182
00:16:44,360 --> 00:16:47,679
Theerade will definitely take our side.

183
00:16:49,559 --> 00:16:52,279
But right now, what worries me most is

184
00:16:53,639 --> 00:16:55,600
whether Shen Xinru alone

185
00:16:57,399 --> 00:16:58,600
has enough clout

186
00:16:58,720 --> 00:17:00,000
to negotiate a deal with Theerade.

187
00:17:01,759 --> 00:17:05,960
Xiao Zhuang's street contact introduced him.

188
00:17:07,319 --> 00:17:08,920
I've checked him out myself.

189
00:17:09,720 --> 00:17:11,839
He talks a big game,

190
00:17:12,920 --> 00:17:14,599
but he has real capability.

191
00:17:18,640 --> 00:17:20,400
Mr. Qin, don't worry.

192
00:17:21,240 --> 00:17:22,839
Once we connect with Shen Xinru,

193
00:17:23,559 --> 00:17:26,559
we'll be dealing across half of China.

194
00:17:31,519 --> 00:17:32,519
If that's the case,

195
00:17:33,640 --> 00:17:35,920
and things keep going like this,

196
00:17:36,240 --> 00:17:39,720
our business will take off in no time.

197
00:17:40,960 --> 00:17:42,319
Still, Old Qin,

198
00:17:42,559 --> 00:17:43,680
our success today

199
00:17:43,880 --> 00:17:45,319
would be impossible without our brothers.

200
00:17:47,960 --> 00:17:48,599
Brother Ma,

201
00:17:49,880 --> 00:17:50,680
where are Tony and the guys?

202
00:17:51,279 --> 00:17:53,680
And what about your buddy Li Qiang?

203
00:17:54,440 --> 00:17:55,640
Something went down earlier,

204
00:17:56,000 --> 00:17:56,880
and we got scattered.

205
00:17:57,079 --> 00:17:58,359
Tony went to dig up some news.

206
00:18:03,200 --> 00:18:04,240
Don't worry, Ma.

207
00:18:04,640 --> 00:18:07,200
I'll send men to find Li Qiang for you.

208
00:18:17,359 --> 00:18:17,839
What's wrong?

209
00:18:20,440 --> 00:18:21,440
I just got word.

210
00:18:22,079 --> 00:18:24,160
Police found a body near the Dai village.

211
00:18:24,880 --> 00:18:25,720
I suspect

212
00:18:28,079 --> 00:18:29,400
it's Boss Ma's brother.

213
00:18:35,880 --> 00:18:36,599
Hold on.

214
00:18:45,119 --> 00:18:46,400
You can rest easy now, right?

215
00:19:01,160 --> 00:19:02,079
I need a favor from you.

216
00:19:02,720 --> 00:19:03,519
Help me track down

217
00:19:03,559 --> 00:19:04,920
the woman Li Qiang coerced.

218
00:19:10,960 --> 00:19:11,759
Li Qiang...

219
00:19:13,519 --> 00:19:16,200
was with me longer than anyone.

220
00:19:17,599 --> 00:19:21,000
I used to tell the boys

221
00:19:21,680 --> 00:19:23,799
that once I made it big,

222
00:19:24,480 --> 00:19:28,119
I'd give them a peaceful life.

223
00:19:32,359 --> 00:19:35,400
But look at how things turned out.

224
00:19:36,880 --> 00:19:38,880
They're all gone, one by one.

225
00:19:43,839 --> 00:19:47,240
Lao Ma, in our line of work,

226
00:19:47,680 --> 00:19:49,400
tomorrow is never guaranteed.

227
00:19:50,480 --> 00:19:53,519
Some things are just fate.

228
00:19:54,559 --> 00:19:58,720
Lao Ma, don't take it too hard.

229
00:19:59,880 --> 00:20:02,640
Fortunately, around you,

230
00:20:03,519 --> 00:20:05,240
you still have so many brothers left.

231
00:20:09,960 --> 00:20:10,799
That's right, Brother Ma.

232
00:20:11,680 --> 00:20:13,079
You still have us.

233
00:20:15,319 --> 00:20:19,160
We will conquer the world by your side.

234
00:20:58,119 --> 00:20:59,960
What's wrong? Something on your mind?

235
00:21:02,599 --> 00:21:06,119
We lost a brother. It's really hard to take.

236
00:21:06,880 --> 00:21:07,440
Jin Qiang.

237
00:21:08,920 --> 00:21:09,880
What happened to him?

238
00:21:12,839 --> 00:21:15,000
Jin Qiang was trying to

239
00:21:15,480 --> 00:21:17,799
intercept Li Qiang before he met Ma Jingrong.

240
00:21:19,680 --> 00:21:20,559
He did that...

241
00:21:22,720 --> 00:21:24,400
He did it all to protect

242
00:21:24,400 --> 00:21:26,799
your and Ge Dan's cover, taking that risk.

243
00:21:41,400 --> 00:21:42,440
Being undercover

244
00:21:43,519 --> 00:21:45,319
really is Dancing on a knife's edge.

245
00:21:47,119 --> 00:21:47,759
Yeah.

246
00:21:49,440 --> 00:21:49,920
By the way,

247
00:21:51,039 --> 00:21:53,279
Qin Mu and Ma Jingrong are both ruthless.

248
00:21:53,680 --> 00:21:56,079
You and Ge Dan must be extra careful now.

249
00:21:59,640 --> 00:22:01,680
I thought you'd caught Li Qiang long ago.

250
00:22:01,759 --> 00:22:02,720
But as soon as I arrived in Country M,

251
00:22:02,920 --> 00:22:04,559
you gave me such a huge surprise.

252
00:22:04,799 --> 00:22:06,480
You almost never saw Ge Dan and me again.

253
00:22:20,680 --> 00:22:21,279
Brother,

254
00:22:22,599 --> 00:22:24,079
I'm truly sorry about this.

255
00:22:24,440 --> 00:22:25,319
It was my mistake.

256
00:22:25,880 --> 00:22:27,160
We at Interpol

257
00:22:27,160 --> 00:22:28,519
will hold diplomatic talks with Country M.

258
00:22:28,839 --> 00:22:29,680
As for Country M,

259
00:22:29,960 --> 00:22:31,599
they're preparing a special task force

260
00:22:31,680 --> 00:22:32,799
to assist your operation.

261
00:22:34,039 --> 00:22:35,440
Giving me false hope again, are you?

262
00:22:36,640 --> 00:22:38,160
Last time you talked my boss into

263
00:22:38,640 --> 00:22:40,119
sending me on a mission to Country M,

264
00:22:40,400 --> 00:22:42,759
promising some international task force.

265
00:22:46,759 --> 00:22:47,599
Whenever we were in danger,

266
00:22:48,200 --> 00:22:49,519
didn't we have to survive on our own?

267
00:22:51,119 --> 00:22:51,960
Who are you, anyway?

268
00:22:52,680 --> 00:22:53,880
You're Zhuang Yan.

269
00:22:54,359 --> 00:22:55,839
What could ever stump you?

270
00:22:59,079 --> 00:23:00,519
All right, stop complaining.

271
00:23:00,559 --> 00:23:02,039
Here, let me show you something good.

272
00:23:05,119 --> 00:23:05,799
This right here

273
00:23:06,240 --> 00:23:07,400
is a pinhole camera.

274
00:23:07,960 --> 00:23:08,960
You know what to do.

275
00:23:15,440 --> 00:23:16,359
Designer brand, huh?

276
00:23:17,240 --> 00:23:19,119
This is openly bribing a police officer.

277
00:23:20,519 --> 00:23:21,279
Do you want it or not?

278
00:23:23,880 --> 00:23:25,400
All right, let's get down to business.

279
00:23:26,279 --> 00:23:27,960
Listen carefully to your next mission.

280
00:23:28,400 --> 00:23:29,839
Every time you meet with Theerade,

281
00:23:30,119 --> 00:23:32,400
make sure you record everything on site.

282
00:23:32,720 --> 00:23:33,680
And these recordings

