562
00:35:24,400 --> 00:35:25,880
As for Jiang Shan's case,

563
00:35:25,960 --> 00:35:28,519
I hope you investigate it to the very end.

564
00:35:29,119 --> 00:35:30,239
Rest assured, Chairman Long.

565
00:35:30,679 --> 00:35:32,239
We will use the Sword of Justice

566
00:35:32,880 --> 00:35:35,079
to catch every criminal tied to Jiang Shan,

567
00:35:35,119 --> 00:35:37,320
leaving no one spared.

568
00:35:37,559 --> 00:35:38,039
Good.

569
00:35:40,039 --> 00:35:41,880
I hope the case is solved soon.

570
00:35:42,559 --> 00:35:43,079
Thank you.

571
00:35:43,360 --> 00:35:44,440
I have a flight to catch,

572
00:35:44,639 --> 00:35:46,159
so I will take my leave now.

573
00:35:47,719 --> 00:35:48,159
All right.

574
00:35:48,679 --> 00:35:49,199
Goodbye.

575
00:35:49,599 --> 00:35:49,960
Goodbye.

576
00:35:50,800 --> 00:35:51,199
Goodbye.

577
00:35:52,320 --> 00:35:52,840
Goodbye.

578
00:36:07,519 --> 00:36:09,400
Do you think Chairman Long knows

579
00:36:09,880 --> 00:36:11,440
that the Sword of Justice

580
00:36:11,800 --> 00:36:13,079
is already hanging over his head?

581
00:36:13,280 --> 00:36:14,840
If he hadn't realized that,

582
00:36:15,719 --> 00:36:17,440
he wouldn't have come here.

583
00:36:20,039 --> 00:36:24,360
Look at him putting on a righteous front.

584
00:36:25,239 --> 00:36:28,719
He's blatantly challenging justice.

585
00:36:30,440 --> 00:36:34,239
Our showdown with him has officially begun.

586
00:36:50,760 --> 00:36:51,360
Chairman,

587
00:36:51,800 --> 00:36:52,960
The Country M Chinese Chamber of Commerce

588
00:36:52,960 --> 00:36:54,760
wants you to speak at tomorrow's banquet.

589
00:36:58,480 --> 00:36:59,639
Tell the president that

590
00:37:00,280 --> 00:37:01,400
I've just joined the chamber

591
00:37:01,679 --> 00:37:03,480
and have much to learn from my seniors.

592
00:37:04,199 --> 00:37:06,559
Giving a speech wouldn't be appropriate.

593
00:37:06,840 --> 00:37:08,440
Still, for such an important occasion,

594
00:37:08,440 --> 00:37:09,400
I will definitely be there.

595
00:37:10,039 --> 00:37:10,480
Understood.

596
00:37:13,440 --> 00:37:15,159
When will we be able to come back?

597
00:37:19,599 --> 00:37:20,199
Soon.

598
00:37:24,480 --> 00:37:25,920
Six months ago, Long Zhiyuan

599
00:37:26,440 --> 00:37:28,360
obtained permanent foreign residency.

600
00:37:29,119 --> 00:37:31,519
Looks like he did this to prepare

601
00:37:31,719 --> 00:37:32,360
for evading the law.

602
00:37:32,639 --> 00:37:34,719
Does he think a foreign green card

603
00:37:35,400 --> 00:37:36,639
will keep him above the law?

604
00:37:37,480 --> 00:37:40,400
Anyone who commits a crime on Chinese soil,

605
00:37:40,599 --> 00:37:42,440
regardless of their green card

606
00:37:42,480 --> 00:37:43,239
or their nationality,

607
00:37:43,519 --> 00:37:45,599
will face the full penalty of Chinese law.

608
00:37:46,800 --> 00:37:48,199
The problem is that Jiang Shan

609
00:37:48,360 --> 00:37:50,320
took the blame for Longze Group's crimes

610
00:37:50,519 --> 00:37:52,320
all upon himself.

611
00:37:53,000 --> 00:37:55,159
If Long Zhiyuan stops now,

612
00:37:55,320 --> 00:37:57,519
it will be hard to uncover

613
00:37:57,519 --> 00:37:58,920
any evidence against him.

614
00:37:59,559 --> 00:38:02,199
Chief, we just got word from the airline.

615
00:38:02,360 --> 00:38:03,920
Long Zhiyuan booked a flight this afternoon

616
00:38:03,920 --> 00:38:06,000
to Country M via Jiaogang.

617
00:38:09,639 --> 00:38:11,079
Heading to Country M at a time like this...

618
00:38:11,960 --> 00:38:13,719
It seems he wants to keep challenging

619
00:38:13,800 --> 00:38:15,519
our Sword of Justice.

620
00:38:15,960 --> 00:38:18,199
Jiang Shan's interrogation hit a dead end.

621
00:38:18,559 --> 00:38:21,320
Where to begin investigating Long Zhiyuan?

622
00:38:21,400 --> 00:38:23,559
Is there any way for us right now

623
00:38:24,000 --> 00:38:25,159
to use Jiang Shan

624
00:38:25,480 --> 00:38:27,280
to get something on Long Zhiyuan?

625
00:38:27,559 --> 00:38:28,639
Jiang Shan's surrender

626
00:38:29,239 --> 00:38:30,320
is clearly driven by a death wish.

627
00:38:31,119 --> 00:38:32,199
There's no way right now

628
00:38:32,880 --> 00:38:34,440
to break him down psychologically.

629
00:38:36,239 --> 00:38:38,199
With Long Zhiyuan going to Country M,

630
00:38:38,400 --> 00:38:40,280
I believe he will definitely meet Piyazi.

631
00:38:41,039 --> 00:38:44,639
Then the true identity of this returnee

632
00:38:44,840 --> 00:38:46,239
will finally surface.

633
00:38:48,599 --> 00:38:49,800
Alert Bai Hua and Inspector Mai.

634
00:38:50,800 --> 00:38:52,440
Keep them updated on Long Zhiyuan's moves.

635
00:38:52,920 --> 00:38:55,320
Have Wei Kai keep close tabs on Piyazi too.

636
00:38:55,800 --> 00:38:58,360
Our joint drug bust will proceed as planned.

637
00:38:59,559 --> 00:39:01,679
Deal a heavy blow to

638
00:39:01,800 --> 00:39:03,079
the traffickers' remnants in Nanhai.

639
00:39:04,800 --> 00:39:06,320
The bigger the waves we make,

640
00:39:06,880 --> 00:39:08,519
the more anxious Long Zhiyuan will become.

641
00:39:27,679 --> 00:39:28,599
Mr. Theerade,

642
00:39:29,679 --> 00:39:32,079
if we partner with this Shen Xinru,

643
00:39:32,559 --> 00:39:33,599
within two years,

644
00:39:33,960 --> 00:39:35,559
our sales volume

645
00:39:35,559 --> 00:39:37,639
could easily double Piyazi's.

646
00:39:37,880 --> 00:39:39,960
A third of the Chinese mainland market

647
00:39:39,960 --> 00:39:42,440
will be in our hands.

648
00:39:43,679 --> 00:39:44,599
This Shen Xinru...

649
00:39:44,599 --> 00:39:46,000
What's his background?

650
00:39:46,039 --> 00:39:46,960
What makes him so capable?

651
00:39:47,199 --> 00:39:49,599
He used to be in the steel business,

652
00:39:49,719 --> 00:39:51,760
so regarding the mainland trade market,

653
00:39:51,760 --> 00:39:52,880
he knows it inside and out.

654
00:39:53,039 --> 00:39:54,760
Recently, he got into drug trafficking,

655
00:39:55,000 --> 00:39:57,519
and made quite a name around Zhuwan.

656
00:39:57,800 --> 00:39:59,400
Shen Xinru...

657
00:40:02,039 --> 00:40:03,760
So you'd heard of him long before.

658
00:40:04,000 --> 00:40:05,719
When Piyazi asked me to find buyers,

659
00:40:05,960 --> 00:40:07,599
Shen Xinru was the top choice.

660
00:40:08,079 --> 00:40:10,519
Take Liu Yong from the Northeast,

661
00:40:10,880 --> 00:40:12,320
or Mr. Guan from East China—

662
00:40:12,400 --> 00:40:15,599
none of them can match his reach.

663
00:40:15,880 --> 00:40:17,480
That's why being able to meet him

664
00:40:17,599 --> 00:40:19,599
in Jiangyang this time

665
00:40:20,360 --> 00:40:21,800
was an incredible opportunity.

666
00:40:22,119 --> 00:40:24,639
I didn't want us to waste it.

667
00:40:25,199 --> 00:40:28,920
You're saying Piyazi also wanted

668
00:40:28,920 --> 00:40:30,320
to work with Shen Xinru?

669
00:40:30,880 --> 00:40:31,960
Exactly.

670
00:40:31,960 --> 00:40:34,559
If I hadn't vetted him beforehand,

671
00:40:34,840 --> 00:40:36,960
I never would've approached him so rashly.

672
00:40:37,760 --> 00:40:40,400
Still, this time Xiao Zhuang's connections

673
00:40:40,639 --> 00:40:42,079
played a decisive role.

674
00:40:42,239 --> 00:40:44,440
Between Xiao Zhuang's insight on the man

675
00:40:44,480 --> 00:40:46,519
and the intel I previously gathered,

676
00:40:46,760 --> 00:40:47,880
looking at the whole picture,

677
00:40:48,039 --> 00:40:51,119
our assessment of him is completely sound.

678
00:40:58,360 --> 00:41:00,400
Actually, after getting your message,

679
00:41:00,960 --> 00:41:02,360
I sent men to look into him.

680
00:41:02,960 --> 00:41:05,840
A year ago, there was a Shen Xinru.

681
00:41:06,320 --> 00:41:07,559
His operations

682
00:41:07,559 --> 00:41:09,599
were mainly in southern China.

683
00:41:10,320 --> 00:41:11,719
The four major families in Country M

684
00:41:12,079 --> 00:41:14,360
have also dealt with his men.

685
00:41:16,159 --> 00:41:17,840
But over the past six months,

686
00:41:18,039 --> 00:41:20,000
he completely dropped off the grid.

687
00:41:20,440 --> 00:41:23,199
Why resurface all of a sudden?

688
00:41:28,920 --> 00:41:30,039
Here's the situation, Mr. Jiang.

689
00:41:30,239 --> 00:41:30,960
Earlier,

690
00:41:31,119 --> 00:41:33,639
the Zhuwan police caused a huge stir,

691
00:41:34,000 --> 00:41:35,159
so Shen Xinru

692
00:41:35,519 --> 00:41:36,880
laid low in France for six months.

693
00:41:37,039 --> 00:41:38,000
Coming back this time,

694
00:41:38,320 --> 00:41:40,480
his main goal is to reclaim his business.

695
00:41:41,239 --> 00:41:43,039
Besides, I also told him about

696
00:41:43,079 --> 00:41:45,159
Mr. Theerade's influence in Jiechan State.

697
00:41:45,480 --> 00:41:46,800
He's extremely interested.

698
00:41:47,800 --> 00:41:51,440
However, he wants to meet

699
00:41:51,440 --> 00:41:52,360
Mr. Theerade in person.

700
00:41:56,639 --> 00:41:58,159
Go back and tell Shen Xinru

701
00:41:58,719 --> 00:42:01,639
that Mr. Theerade never personally meets

702
00:42:01,719 --> 00:42:03,639
any client to talk business.

703
00:42:04,920 --> 00:42:05,920
Mr. Theerade,

704
00:42:06,280 --> 00:42:09,599
Shen Xinru controls distribution channels

705
00:42:09,599 --> 00:42:11,960
across 22 mainland Chinese cities.

706
00:42:12,039 --> 00:42:13,719
If we don't partner with him,

707
00:42:14,480 --> 00:42:16,840
he might turn to Piyazi,

708
00:42:17,199 --> 00:42:18,920
or even the four major families.

709
00:42:21,159 --> 00:42:23,519
Since Boss Shen is being so sincere,

710
00:42:24,239 --> 00:42:27,480
there's no need to turn him down flat.

711
00:42:27,920 --> 00:42:29,199
Besides, I'm quite keen

712
00:42:29,199 --> 00:42:30,960
on meeting Boss Shen myself.

713
00:42:31,239 --> 00:42:33,159
Still, there's no rush.

714
00:42:33,320 --> 00:42:36,000
I'll arrange a suitable time in a few days

715
00:42:36,119 --> 00:42:37,400
to meet him in Hirano.

716
00:42:37,960 --> 00:42:40,119
Besides, Xiao Zhuang cleared customs.

717
00:42:40,400 --> 00:42:41,440
Down the line, our shipments

718
00:42:41,599 --> 00:42:44,519
won't lack ways to enter China,

719
00:42:45,239 --> 00:42:45,679
will they?

720
00:42:46,800 --> 00:42:47,840
As long as there are buyers,

721
00:42:48,239 --> 00:42:50,840
distribution and transit won't be an issue.

722
00:42:51,079 --> 00:42:51,639
Good.

723
00:42:52,159 --> 00:42:53,079
For the current shipments,

724
00:42:53,400 --> 00:42:55,320
Mr. Jiang has already lined up buyers.

725
00:42:55,639 --> 00:42:56,280
Tony,

726
00:42:56,960 --> 00:42:58,119
stick close to Mr. Jiang for now

727
00:42:58,119 --> 00:42:59,280
and help him out.

728
00:43:00,159 --> 00:43:02,639
Xiao Zhuang just needs to handle customs.

729
00:43:03,519 --> 00:43:04,920
We'll follow your orders, sir.

730
00:43:06,360 --> 00:43:06,920
By the way...

731
00:43:07,159 --> 00:43:08,920
I heard right after arriving in Country M,

732
00:43:10,199 --> 00:43:11,360
you guys were ambushed.

733
00:43:14,960 --> 00:43:16,760
It was Piyazi.

734
00:43:18,719 --> 00:43:21,119
Even if you used to work under Piyazi

735
00:43:21,360 --> 00:43:22,639
and switched bosses,

736
00:43:24,159 --> 00:43:26,480
they shouldn't have gone so far

737
00:43:27,280 --> 00:43:28,559
as to try and take your life.
